.DS_Store
# Machine-local Package Control artifact inside the symlinked Sublime User dirs
Package Control.user-ca-bundle
# License files must never reach the public repo. The Monokai Pro
# license lives in the PRIVATE dotfiles repo, whose installer links it
# into the symlinked Sublime User dir — this rule keeps that link (or
# the raw file the app writes on a machine without the private repo)
# out of the public tree.
app/sublime-*/User/Theme - Monokai Pro.sublime-settings
